---

Optional speech recognition uses whisper.cpp (MIT License)
  https://github.com/ggml-org/whisper.cpp
The whisper-cli engine is included in official release packages by default
(built/staged via scripts/make-whisper-bin.sh during packaging). Slim builds
may omit it with HIP_BUNDLE_WHISPER=0.

Whisper model weights are subject to the OpenAI Whisper model license /
use terms as redistributed by the Hugging Face ggerganov/whisper.cpp repo.
Models are downloaded on demand to ~/.hip/models/whisper/ and are not
shipped in the hip application package.

---

The terminal embeds a subset of JetBrainsMono Nerd Font Mono (SIL OFL 1.1)
  https://github.com/ryanoasis/nerd-fonts (release v3.5.0)
  https://github.com/JetBrains/JetBrainsMono
Generated via scripts/fetch-nerd-font.mjs (see scripts/font-manifest.json
for pinned version and checksums). License texts ship alongside the font
assets in public/fonts/nerd/ (LICENSE-OFL.txt, LICENSE-NerdFonts.txt).
The underlying JetBrains Mono font is SIL OFL 1.1; the Nerd Fonts patch
scripts are MIT. The subset woff2 files are included in all release
packages by default.
